# ARAG Demo Factory — Project Rules

This repo is a **one-shot demo factory** for **Progress Agentic RAG (ARAG / Nuclia)**. A
sales engineer fires **one prompt**; you map it to a catalog blueprint × capabilities and
build a themed, grounded, cited research portal end-to-end — no menu, no pausing.

- **Read `AGENTS.md`** — it is authoritative for orchestration, the catalog, the pipeline,
  and the Hard Rules. `CLAUDE.md` is the quick reference.
- **ONE SHOT, NO MENU.** On the first message, load `catalog/catalog.json`, score the prompt
  against blueprint `matchTags`, pick the best blueprint, honour explicit capability
  add/drop modifiers, echo a single `Building: …` line, then run Phases 0-6 without pausing.
  Only ask a question if the prompt has zero domain signal (a bare "hi") — and then ask one
  open question, never a menu. This is the deliberate INVERSE of the PDP reference package's
  "always show A/B/C/D" rule. Do not copy that rule here.
- **Nuclia does the retrieval.** No local vector store or second index over corpus content.
  All retrieval + generation is ARAG (`/ask`, `/find`, `/catalog`, `/graph`).
- **Never rewrite the portal shell — configure it** via `demo.config.json`.
- **Answers must render citations.** An ungrounded answer is a warning, never bare text.
- **Hard Rules (non-negotiable):** synthetic only, no real brands, anonymise identities, no
  residency/zone strings on screen, visible disclaimer, KB token server-side only.

## MCP

The `nuclia` MCP server is the primary interface for all Knowledge Box work
(`search_documents`, `get_document`, `batch_get_documents`, ingest/write tools). MCP lives
in the **orchestrator's** runtime — subagents don't inherit it, so all KB work (bind,
ingest, configure, verify) stays in the orchestrator's loop; delegate only file/code
generation. Fall back to the ARAG REST API only if MCP is unavailable, or for non-Nuclia
targets (the portal's own server/UI).

## Architecture

```
Portal (Vite + React + TS, config-driven, one shell)
  -> Express server (server/index.mjs) — holds NUCLIA_SERVICEACCOUNT, proxies ARAG
       -> Progress Agentic RAG (Nuclia) — /ask /find /catalog /graph /resources predict/chat mcp
  -> demo.config.json — blueprint × capabilities drive which surfaces render + theme + KB binding
```

## Key files

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| Orchestration (authoritative) | `AGENTS.md` |
| The shopping list | `catalog/` (`catalog.json`, `blueprints/`, `capabilities/`) |
| Composer / scaffolder | `create-app.js` |
| Portal shell | `portal/` |
| Canonical Nuclia surface | `docs/ARAG-API.md` |
| Live portfolio snapshot | `DEMOS.md` |
